			<div class="content" id="post-content-1452258">
									

<p>This isn't bad, but it just doesn't sit right with me. I think the problem with it is that it's just sort of a mishmash of interesting concepts that don't really gel. They're invisible-ish, they're lethally curious, they've got incredibly sharp claws; they're all interesting attributes that aren't naturally cohesive to one another. There's a couple tone errors sprinkled in there too (calling them &quot;stealthy&quot; seems sort of off, and the second paragraph seems sort of awkwardly constructed), but they're nothing too major.</p>
<p>Overall&#8230;I dunno. Like I said, there's nothing really that wrong with it; it probably just comes down to personal tastes on my part.</p>

